{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slide":2,"text":"Use the real Schneider Electric FY2025 table to show that visual clarity is not the same as machine-readable structure.\nThe default pdfplumber detector identifies geometry, but the returned 9 × 15 matrix contains blank separator cells and ambiguous headers. The learning objective is to validate the schema before trusting extracted numbers.\n[Sources]\n- https://www.se.com/ww/en/assets/564/document/528237/release-fy-results-2025.pdf (official Schneider Electric FY2025 results; table image on slide)\n- https://github.com/jsvine/pdfplumber (official pdfplumber documentation; extraction behavior described on slide)\n[/Sources]"}
