{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slide":6,"text":"Separate three decisions. Embedding model plus threshold creates semantic boundaries. Parent-child links separate matching from reading. Contextual enrichment is one bounded JSON transformation, not agentic chunking; generated context augments immutable raw_text. The 1.37x token ratio is the deterministic Notebook 05 offline measurement.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/embeddings\n- https://docs.ollama.com/capabilities/embeddings\n- Course Notebook 05 offline execution, contextual-chunks-v1\n[/Sources]"}
